val method = "## Method and units\nWeights are fixed targets restored at the start of every month. Returns are monthly total-return percentages with reinvestment. Wealth compounds without intermediate rounding. Cumulative return (%) = 100 x (wealth / initial capital - 1). Drawdown (%) = 100 x (wealth / running peak - 1), and month 0 is included in the peak. No taxes, leverage, deposits, withdrawals or trading frictions are modeled."

